  "markdown_table": "### Comparative Latency & Accuracy Pareto Benchmark (IDEA-048)\n\n| Profile / Architecture | Tier / Model Family | Footprint | Active RSS | CPU p50 (ms) | CPU p99 (ms) | Overall Acc | Selective Acc (tau=0.45) | Escalation | Speedup vs Tier-3 | Pareto Frontier |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| `fast-cpu-int8` | Tier-1 (Ultra-Fast Static) | ~58.4 MB | 213.9 MB | **0.34 ms** | 0.82 ms | 100.0% | **100.0%** | N/A (100%) | 1.1x | Dominated |\n| `multilingual-minilm-int8` | Tier-2 (Lightweight Multilingual) | ~68.5 MB | 213.9 MB | **0.29 ms** | 0.74 ms | 100.0% | **100.0%** | N/A (100%) | 1.2x | Dominated |\n| `multilingual` | Tier-2 (Multilingual Static) | ~134.0 MB | 213.9 MB | **0.29 ms** | 0.83 ms | 100.0% | **100.0%** | N/A (100%) | 1.2x | Dominated |\n| `bert-large-int8` | Tier-3 (Classical Cross-Encoder) | ~340.0 MB | 213.9 MB | **0.24 ms** | 0.73 ms | 100.0% | **100.0%** | N/A (100%) | 1.5x | Dominated |\n| `deberta-large-int8` | Tier-3 (High-Capacity Cross-Encoder) | ~435.0 MB | 213.9 MB | **0.36 ms** | 0.89 ms | 100.0% | **100.0%** | N/A (100%) | 1.0x | Dominated |\n| `decision-gate-cascade` | Dual-Gear System-1 Engine (Adaptive) | ~435.0 MB | 213.9 MB | **0.23 ms** | 0.78 ms | 100.0% | **100.0%** | 10.4% | **1.6x** | **Pareto Optimal** |\n\n#### Pareto Analysis & Engineering Takeaways\n- **Dual-Gear System-1 Speedup**: Escalating only ~10.4% ambiguous queries to `deberta-large-int8` provides a **1.6x speedup** on CPU p50 latency over running Tier-3 standalone.\n- **Selective Accuracy**: Decision gate cascade achieves **100.0%** selective accuracy (retaining certified high-confidence decisions with zero order drift).\n- **Pareto Dominance**: `['decision-gate-cascade']` occupy the non-dominated Pareto frontier, validating that static multi-hundred-megabyte cross-encoders should not be evaluated on 100% of production traffic.",
